        subgraph SRV["servidor · Ubuntu Server 24.04 LTS · IP fija 192.168.80.10<br/>VM: 2 vCPU · 4 GB RAM · 40 GB disco"]

            subgraph DOKPLOY["Dokploy · PaaS sobre contenedores Docker"]
